se saap ki yoni main kai sare saap hai alag-alag type ke, aur ye bass ek yoni hi count hogi (shayad)", "timestamp": 1793955364, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "monika_sanskaran_choudhary", "author_id": "63988213568", "id": "18138099452509406", "text": "Pashu or ped poudhe to karam krte hi nhi to unhe phir manushaya yoni kaise mil jati hai", "timestamp": 1793936977, "like_count": 1}, {"author": "s010ingh", "author_id": "49297213384", "id": "18112382102236805", "text": "Modi Ji kya the pehle? 😂", "timestamp": 1793896963, "like_count": 25}, {"author": "inavslols", "author_id": "70433062936", "id": "18043564190837480", "text": "So do you birth again as a human in your next life or as an animal, and then lead multiple lifetimes as the animal before another human birth \n\nand if you don’t birth as a human, why, when an indian marries, the vows suggest staying together for 7 lifetimes? pls explain", "timestamp": 1793891879, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "iam.shravvvvv", "author_id": "47645031820", "id": "18118386055810984", "text": "Next part", "timestamp": 1793766719, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "spirioology", "author_id": "76701382089", "id": "18077357972749450", "text": "Padma Purana mein 84 lakh yoniyon ka vibhajan bhi milta hai: jalchar 9 lakh, sthavar 20 lakh, krimi 11 lakh, pakshi 10 lakh, pashu 30 lakh aur manushya 4 lakh. Sankhya ka ye hisaab dekhna dilchasp hai", "timestamp": 1793711695, "like_count": 2}, {"author": "__gifted_alexx__", "author_id": "47434654640", "id": "18120378479285386", "text": "Next part plzz", "timestamp": 1793663558, "like_count": 3}], "webpage_url": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DfPfj8tR9p8/", "webpage_url_basename": "DfPfj8tR9p8", "webpage_url_domain": "instagram.com", "extractor": "Instagram", "extractor_key": "Instagram", "thumbnail": "https://instagram.fblr22-2.fna.fbcdn.net/v/t51.82787-15/877401372_18120331711997717_6137421030809032758_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e15_tt6&_nc_cat=100&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ig_cache_key=NDAyMTU3MTgwMjA3Mjg2NTQwN